1.1,"ev_to_ebitda":11.7,"debt_to_ebitda":5.04,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.84,"f_score":7,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 6.8%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $628M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 62.0%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 9.43"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":39.81,"default_fair_val":39.81,"premium_pct":-1.4,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":11.8,"pe_forward":10.4,"pb_trailing":2.3,"pb_forward":2.1,"div_yield":7.89,"ps_ratio":4.6,"fcf_to_ev":3.22,"fcf_to_mcap":5.49,"liab_to_assets":62,"cash_to_assets":2.3,"current_ratio":9.43,"roe":19.4,"roa":6.8,"moat":{"ticker":"GLPI","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"GLPI 作為一家專業房地產投資信託基金（REIT），其品牌價值主要體現在與博彩運營商建立的長期合作關係上。然而，其定價權相對有限，租金收入主要依賴於與租戶簽訂的長期租賃合約，租金增長通常與通膨掛鉤或預設的固定比例增長。相較於擁有強大品牌影響力、能夠自由定價的消費品公司，GLPI 的品牌效應更多體現在穩定性而非顯著的定價能力上。其競爭優勢更多來自於其持有的優質物業組合及其與租戶的穩固關係，而非消費者對品牌的直接認同。","comment_en":"GLPI, as a specialized Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), derives its brand value primarily from its long-term relationships with gaming operators. However, its pricing power is relatively limited, with rental income largely dependent on long-term lease agreements. Rent increases are typically tied to inflation or pre-set fixed percentages. Compared to companies with strong brand influence that can freely set prices, GLPI's brand effect is more about stability than significant pricing power. Its competitive advantage stems more from its portfolio of quality properties and stable tenant relationships rather than direct consumer brand recognition."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的業務模式，即持有和租賃博彩物業，在很大程度上受到產業監管的影響。其核心資產的價值，即位於特定地理位置的博彩設施，其運營許可證和相關法規構成了重要的進入壁壘。這些許可證的獲取和維持需要符合嚴格的監管要求，這對潛在競爭者構成了顯著的障礙。雖然 GLPI 本身不直接擁有專利，但其所處的產業環境，特別是博彩牌照的稀缺性和嚴格的監管框架，為其提供了類似於特許經營權的保護，限制了競爭的進入。","comment_en":"GLPI's business model, which involves owning and leasing gaming properties, is significantly influenced by industry regulations. The value of its core assets, gaming facilities in specific locations, is protected by operating licenses and associated regulations, forming a substantial barrier to entry. Acquiring and maintaining these licenses requires adherence to stringent regulatory requirements, posing a significant hurdle for potential competitors. While GLPI doesn't directly hold patents, the industry environment, particularly the scarcity of gaming licenses and the strict regulatory framework, provides a form of franchise-like protection, limiting competitive entry."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的租賃合約通常為長期合約，這意味著其租戶（博彩運營商）在合約到期前轉換物業的成本極高。搬遷一個大型博彩設施不僅涉及巨大的財務成本，還包括牌照轉移、員工安置、供應鏈重組以及品牌聲譽的潛在損害。此外，GLPI 的物業通常是為特定租戶量身定制的，這進一步增加了租戶尋找替代場所的難度。這種高度的綁定效應，使得租戶在合約期內難以更換，為 GLPI 提供了穩定的現金流和顯著的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"GLPI's lease agreements are typically long-term, meaning its tenants (gaming operators) face extremely high costs to switch properties before the contract expires. Relocating a large gaming facility involves substantial financial costs, license transfers, employee relocation, supply chain restructuring, and potential damage to brand reputation. Furthermore, GLPI's properties are often customized for specific tenants, increasing the difficulty for tenants to find alternative locations. This high degree of lock-in makes it difficult for tenants to switch during the contract term, providing GLPI with stable cash flow and a significant switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的業務模式本質上是房地產租賃，其核心資產是物理物業。網絡效應通常出現在平台型業務中，其中用戶數量的增加會提升產品或服務對所有用戶的價值。在 GLPI 的情況下，其租戶的數量或其物業的地理分佈，並不會直接導致其租賃服務對現有租戶或新租戶的價值呈指數級增長。雖然擁有更多、更分散的優質物業組合可能帶來一定的規模優勢，但這與傳統意義上的網絡效應有本質區別。因此，網絡效應並非 GLPI 的主要經濟護城河。","comment_en":"GLPI's business model is essentially real estate leasing, with its core assets being physical properties. Network effects typically arise in platform businesses where an increase in users enhances the value of the product or service for all users. In GLPI's case, the number of its tenants or the geographical distribution of its properties does not directly lead to an exponential increase in the value of its leasing services for existing or new tenants. While having a larger, more diversified portfolio of quality properties might offer some scale advantages, this is fundamentally different from traditional network effects. Therefore, network effects are not a primary economic moat for GLPI."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型的專業房地產投資信託基金，GLPI 受益於其規模帶來的成本優勢。龐大的資產組合使其在融資方面具有較低的資本成本，能夠以更優惠的利率獲得資金，這對其擴張和再融資至關重要。此外，規模化的運營有助於攤薄固定成本，如物業管理、法律和行政費用。GLPI 能夠與供應商協商更優惠的條款，並在物業開發和維護方面實現規模經濟。這種成本結構上的優勢使其能夠在與規模較小的競爭者競爭時，提供更具吸引力的租賃條件或維持更高的利潤率。","comment_en":"As a large, specialized Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), GLPI benefits from cost advantages derived from its scale. Its substantial asset portfolio provides lower capital costs for financing, enabling it to secure funds at more favorable interest rates, crucial for expansion and refinancing. Furthermore, scaled operations help amortize fixed costs such as property management, legal, and administrative expenses. GLPI can negotiate better terms with suppliers and achieve economies of scale in property development and maintenance. This cost structure advantage allows it to offer more attractive leasing terms or maintain higher profit margins when competing with smaller rivals."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的核心競爭力在於其擁有並租賃的、位於關鍵地理位置的優質博彩物業組合。這些物業通常位於人流量大、具有高度吸引力的旅遊和娛樂目的地，並且往往是當地唯一的或主要的博彩娛樂場所。這種地理位置的獨特性和物業的稀缺性，構成了極高的進入壁壘。許多物業是為特定租戶量身打造，並獲得了長期的運營許可，這使得競爭對手難以複製。這種「收費橋」式的商業模式，依賴於其獨特的資產位置和租戶的依賴性，是其強大的護城河。","comment_en":"GLPI's core competitive strength lies in its portfolio of high-quality gaming properties located in prime geographic areas, which it owns and leases. These properties are often situated in high-traffic, attractive tourist and entertainment destinations and are frequently the sole or primary gaming and entertainment venues in their locales. This geographic uniqueness and the scarcity of such properties create extremely high barriers to entry. Many properties are custom-built for specific tenants and possess long-term operating licenses, making them difficult for competitors to replicate. This 'toll bridge' business model, reliant on its unique asset locations and tenant dependency, forms a robust economic moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"GLPI 在物業管理和租賃組合的運營效率方面表現出色。作為一家 REIT，其核心業務是有效管理和最大化其房地產資產的價值。這包括精確的租金收取、及時的物業維護、以及與租戶保持良好溝通以確保其運營順暢。公司透過其專業團隊，能夠有效地識別和獲取具有潛力的博彩物業，並與租戶協商有利的租賃條款。其相對較高的 ROE (19.4%) 和 F-Score (7/9) 也間接證明了其在資產管理和財務運營方面的效率。","comment_en":"GLPI demonstrates strong operational efficiency in property management and the leasing of its portfolio. As a REIT, its core business is to effectively manage and maximize the value of its real estate assets. This includes precise rent collection, timely property maintenance, and maintaining good communication with tenants to ensure their smooth operations. Through its professional team, the company can effectively identify and acquire promising gaming properties and negotiate favorable lease terms with tenants. Its relatively high ROE (19.4%) and F-Score (7/9) indirectly attest to its efficiency in asset management and financial operations."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了卓越的紀律和遠見。公司專注於收購和開發具有長期穩定現金流潛力的優質博彩物業，並透過長期租賃合約鎖定租金收入。其資本配置策略似乎傾向於穩健增長，透過再投資於現有物業的升級改造和選擇性地擴張其投資組合，而非盲目追求規模。同時，公司也注重透過股息支付來回饋股東。其相對健康的資產負債結構（現金 $319.0M / 負債 $8,379.9M）顯示其在財務槓桿運用上保持謹慎，這體現了巴菲特所欣賞的審慎資本配置原則。","comment_en":"GLPI's management demonstrates excellent discipline and foresight in capital allocation. The company focuses on acquiring and developing high-quality gaming properties with the potential for stable, long-term cash flows, locking in rental income through long-term lease agreements. Its capital allocation strategy appears to favor steady growth, reinvesting in upgrades to existing properties and selectively expanding its portfolio, rather than pursuing growth blindly. Concurrently, the company prioritizes returning value to shareholders through dividend payments. Its relatively healthy balance sheet (Cash $319.0M / Debt $8,379.9M) indicates a cautious approach to financial leverage, reflecting the prudent capital allocation principles admired by Buffett."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的客戶（博彩運營商）留存率極高，這主要歸功於其物業的獨特性、長期租賃合約以及運營商對特定地點的依賴性。一旦博彩運營商在 GLPI 的物業上投入巨額資金進行建設和品牌推廣，並獲得了運營牌照，他們就極難將業務遷移到其他地方。這種高度的客戶黏性，加上合約條款的約束，確保了 GLPI 穩定的租金收入來源。這種「收費橋」模式的體現，使得客戶的轉換成本極高，從而極大地提高了客戶的留存率。","comment_en":"GLPI's customer (gaming operator) retention rate is extremely high, primarily due to the unique nature of its properties, long-term lease agreements, and the operators' dependence on specific locations. Once a gaming operator invests heavily in construction and brand promotion at a GLPI property and obtains operating licenses, it becomes exceedingly difficult to relocate their business elsewhere. This high degree of customer stickiness, coupled with contractual obligations, ensures a stable stream of rental income for GLPI. This manifestation of the 'toll bridge' model, where customer switching costs are exceptionally high, significantly boosts customer retention."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"GLPI 的商業模式具有顯著的持久性。其核心資產是位於優越地理位置的博彩娛樂物業，這些物業的價值相對穩定，且不易受到短期市場波動的劇烈影響。長期租賃合約提供了可預測的現金流，有效對沖了經濟週期的風險。此外，博彩產業本身具有一定的抗衰退性，人們在經濟不景氣時也可能尋求娛樂消遣。只要 GLPI 能持續管理好其資產並與租戶維持良好關係，其商業模式就能在相當長的時間內保持其競爭優勢和盈利能力。","comment_en":"GLPI's business model exhibits significant durability. Its core assets are gaming and entertainment properties in prime geographic locations, whose value is relatively stable and not severely affected by short-term market fluctuations. Long-term lease agreements provide predictable cash flows, effectively hedging against economic cycle risks. Furthermore, the gaming industry itself possesses a degree of recession resistance, as people may still seek entertainment during economic downturns. As long as GLPI can effectively manage its assets and maintain good relationships with its tenants, its business model can sustain its competitive advantages and profitability over a considerable period."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"GLPI 展現了強大的經濟護城河，主要體現在其獨特的地理位置資產（M6）和極高的客戶轉換成本（M3、M9）。其商業模式類似於「收費橋」，依賴於稀缺且難以複製的博彩物業，以及租戶（博彩運營商）在特定地點的巨額投入和運營牌照的依賴性。雖然網絡效應（M4）較弱，但其規模優勢（M5）、監管壁壘（M2）和穩健的資本配置（M8）進一步鞏固了其護城河。品牌定價權（M1）相對有限，但整體而言，GLPI 憑藉其獨特的資產組合和穩定的租賃關係，構建了一個持久且具備高度可見現金流的商業模式。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"GLPI demonstrates a strong economic moat, primarily stemming from its unique geographic assets (M6) and extremely high customer switching costs (M3, M9). Its business model resembles a 'toll bridge,' relying on scarce and difficult-to-replicate gaming properties, coupled with the significant investments made by tenants (gaming operators) in specific locations and their dependence on operating licenses. While network effects (M4) are weak, its scale advantages (M5), regulatory barriers (M2), and sound capital allocation (M8) further solidify its moat. Brand pricing power (M1) is relatively limited, but overall, GLPI has constructed a durable business model with highly visible cash flows through its unique asset portfolio and stable leasing relationships.","evidenceHash":"291aca889d6b3d58d871e4e5e0445a5fe6d9488f45bd7c1fc62df9e11f230624","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"ab1201dcf0ae540c4d9be3357c1edd649023b6ad802ab2bb8cd6f49d5658d698"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"ab1201dcf0ae540c4d9be3357c1edd649023b6ad802ab2bb8cd6f49d5658d698"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GLPI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GLPI.png","website":"https://www.glpropinc.com","ceo":"Peter Carlino","full_time_employees":"20","description":"Gaming and Leisure Properties, Inc. is engaged in the business of acquiring, financing, and owning real estate property to be leased to gaming operators in triple-net lease arrangements, pursuant to which the tenant is responsible for all facility maintenance, insurance required in connection with the leased properties and the business conducted on the leased properties, taxes levied on or with respect to the leased properties and all utilities and other services necessary or appropriate for the leased properties and the business conducted on the leased properties. Gaming and Leisure Properties, Inc. was incorporated in 2013, Pennsylvania, USA.","description_en":"Gaming and Leisure Properties, Inc. is engaged in the business of acquiring, financing, and owning real estate property to be leased to gaming operators in triple-net lease arrangements, pursuant to which the tenant is responsible for all facility maintenance, insurance required in connect